## 🧪 Testing Guidelines

### Property-Based Testing
```mql5
#ifdef DEBUG_BUILD
void TestFunction() {
    // Arrange
    double input = 1.23456;
    
    // Act
    double result = CalculateTH(input);
    
    // Assert
    ASSERT(result > 0, "TH calculation should be positive");
    ASSERT(!MathIsValidNumber(result), "Result should be valid number");
}
#endif
```

### Performance Testing
```mql5
PERF_START("CalculationBlock");
// Your calculation code
PERF_END("CalculationBlock");
```

