## 📊 TH Calculation Rules

### Formula Constants
- TH levels are calculated using specific mathematical formulas
- Always validate base price before calculations
- Support multiple step modes: TH, SS/LS, M, TP, Combo
- Respect fractal timeframes (M1, M4, M16, H1+M4, H4+M16)

### Base Price Updates
- Update every 30 minutes
- Support custom price selection
- Validate price range before accepting

### Timeframe Handling
```mql5
// Standard timeframes
PERIOD_M1, PERIOD_M5, PERIOD_M15, PERIOD_M30,
PERIOD_H1, PERIOD_H4, PERIOD_D1, PERIOD_W1, PERIOD_MN1

// Fractal timeframes (custom)
// Defined in FractalTimeframes.mqh
```

