## 🆘 When Helping with Code

### DO:
✅ Follow MQL5 syntax strictly
✅ Use existing helper functions from project includes
✅ Maintain consistent naming conventions
✅ Add proper error handling
✅ Include both English and Persian comments
✅ Consider performance implications
✅ Write testable code
✅ Use conditional compilation for debug code
✅ Validate all inputs
✅ Check array bounds

### DON'T:
❌ Use MQL4 syntax or functions
❌ Ignore memory management
❌ Create unnecessary global variables
❌ Skip input validation
❌ Use magic numbers (define constants)
❌ Write functions longer than 100 lines
❌ Ignore error return values
❌ Use deprecated functions
❌ Hardcode strings (use constants)
❌ Forget to clean up in OnDeinit()

